  "description": "Fantastic 3-BEDROOM APARTMENT in the home town the National Steam Rally.\n\nElite Estate Agents Ltd are proud to bring to the Lettings market this NEW 3-bedroom apartment, located in the heart of Stradbally, Co. Laois.\n\n Property Features:\n\nSpacious 3-bedroom( all double) accommodation, one being en-suite and a main bathroom with a shower, large open plan kitchen/dining/living room and dining room, & a large utility room. Electric heating by panel heaters. \nModern, stylish interior\nExcellent location in the heart of Stradbally\nWalking distance to local cafes, supervalu ,hairdressers ,barbers and pharmacy \n\nA superb apartment combining comfort, convenience and luxury living in one of Laois's most charming towns.\n\nEnquiries by email ONLY , please. \n\nPortlaoise: Approximately 10 minutes away\n\nLift to 1st floor \n\nOutside : Communal Parking and communal roof top garden \n\nServices : \nMains Water, Mains Sewage, Electric Heating\n\nDirections : \nVale view is a residential complex above a retail complex in Stradbally town centre.",
